COST..  - 90000*I(tp) - 35000*I(wc) - 120*X(tp) - 150*X(wc) + TCOST =E= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     

---- MaxCap  =L=  Maximum capacity of source when built (ac-ft per year)

MaxCap(tp)..  - 2000*I(tp) + X(tp) =L= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     
