MinReqUse(tp)..  X(tp) =G= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     
MinReqUse(wc)..  - 1000*I(wc) + X(wc) =G= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     

---- MeetDemand  =G=  Meet demand (ac-ft per year)

MeetDemand..  X(tp) + X(wc) =G= 2000 ; (LHS = 0, INFES = 2000 ****)
     

